@startuml
!theme plain
title Create and schedule a content draft

actor Admin
participant "Admin UI" as UI
participant "Content Studio API" as API
participant "Generation Service" as Gen
participant "Brand Review" as Review
participant "Media Service" as Media
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Postiz Bridge" as Postiz

Admin -> UI: Create idea
UI -> API: POST /ideas
API -> DB: insert idea
API --> UI: idea

Admin -> UI: Generate brief + drafts
UI -> API: POST /ideas/{id}/generate
API -> Gen: generate brief/captions
Gen --> API: candidates
API -> Review: score candidates
Review --> API: scores + warnings
API -> DB: insert generation_run + drafts
API --> UI: drafts

Admin -> UI: Select asset + approve
UI -> API: POST /drafts/{id}/approve
API -> Media: verify asset rights/status
Media --> API: ok
API -> DB: status approved + audit
API --> UI: approved draft

Admin -> UI: Schedule
UI -> API: POST /posts/{id}/schedule
API -> Postiz: upload media if needed
Postiz --> API: postiz media id/url
API -> Postiz: create schedule post
Postiz --> API: postiz post id
API -> DB: status scheduled + delivery log
API --> UI: scheduled
@enduml

